Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.AUTHORREFERENCE
Column name: Refno Type: NUMBER Description: this reference number is always an integer, between 1 and 50000
Column name: NameOrder Type: NUMBER Description: an integer between 1 and 228, indicating the position of this author's name in the list of authors for this reference
Column name: Name Type: TEXT Description: eg 'Mitelman F', or 'Rowley JD'
Sample rows:
[{'Refno': 10, 'Name': 'Hayata I', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 13, 'Name': 'Hayata I', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 14, 'Name': 'Mitelman F', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 15, 'Name': 'Shah-Reddy I', 'NameOrder': 1}, {'Refno': 16, 'Name': 'Rowley JD', 'NameOrder': 1}]

