Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.KARYBIT
Column name: CloneNo Type: NUMBER Description: clone number
Column name: RefNo Type: NUMBER Description: reference number
Column name: Bit Type: TEXT Description: karyotype 'bit', eg '46', or 'Xy', or 'idem', etc
Column name: CaseNo Type: TEXT Description: case number, usually an integer but can be a string, eg 'A11'
Column name: OrderNo Type: NUMBER Description: order number
Column name: InvNo Type: NUMBER Description: investigation number
Sample rows:
[{'RefNo': 524, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 623, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 631, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 660, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}, {'RefNo': 693, 'CaseNo': '1', 'InvNo': 1, 'CloneNo': 1, 'OrderNo': 1, 'Bit': '??'}]

