Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.RECURRENTNUMDATA
Column name: Chromosome Type: TEXT Description: number between 1 and 48
Column name: Topo Type: TEXT Description: topography code, eg '0902' (or blank)
Column name: Abnormality Type: TEXT Description: abnormality description, eg '-22', or '-X', or '+15', etc
Column name: ChrOrder Type: NUMBER Description: numeric order of the chromosome
Column name: Morph Type: TEXT Description: morphology code, eg '3111'
Column name: TotalCases Type: TEXT Description: total number of cases (up to 2211)
Sample rows:
[{'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1202', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '36', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1501', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '73', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1505', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '97', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1509', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '33', 'ChrOrder': 1}, {'Chromosome': '1', 'Abnormality': '+1', 'Morph': '1602', 'Topo': None, 'TotalCases': '254', 'ChrOrder': 1}]

