Table full name: MITELMAN.PROD.RECURRENTDATA
Column name: TotalCases Type: TEXT Description: total number of cases (up to 2150)
Column name: Chromosome Type: TEXT Description: chromosome number (1- 22, X or Y)
Column name: Arm Type: TEXT Description: arm of the chromosome (p or q)
Column name: Type Type: TEXT Description: indicate balanced ('B') or unbalanced ('U')
Column name: Band Type: TEXT Description: position of the gene on the p or q arm
Column name: Topo Type: TEXT Description: topography code, eg '0902' (or blank)
Column name: Abnormality Type: TEXT Description: abnormality description, eg 'add(19)(q13)' or 'del(20)(q11q13)'
Column name: Morph Type: TEXT Description: morphology code, eg '1602'
Column name: Gene Type: TEXT Description: gene symbol(s), eg 'KMT2A+' or 'BCR/ABL1' or blank
Column name: ChrOrder Type: NUMBER Description: numeric order of the chromosome
